      "source": [
        "# Free variable\n",
        "\n",
        "A free variable is used in a block but not bound locally in that block. For example, a nested function can refer to a variable from an enclosing function.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-free-variable)"
      ]
    }
  ],
